# MASTER PROMPT: IMPLEMENT A COMPLETE, FULLY CONFIGURABLE HVAC WEBSITE ADMINISTRATION PLATFORM

## PRIMARY DIRECTIVE

Upgrade the existing HVAC website into a comprehensive, production-oriented, full-stack website and business management platform with a powerful, secure, and intuitive administration panel.

This is an extension of an existing application. You must inspect and preserve the current project, its codebase, branding, routes, design system, components, integrations, and working features before making changes.

Do not rebuild the application from scratch unless an existing architectural defect makes a specific component unusable. Reuse and improve the existing implementation wherever possible.

The goal is to give an authorized administrator complete control over the public-facing website, its design, colors, content, navigation, services, functionality, integrations, business settings, and market-specific presentation without requiring source-code changes for routine modifications.

Additionally, make the public website content universally relevant to prospective HVAC customers across different cities, states, regions, and countries.

All requirements below are mandatory unless explicitly identified as requiring external configuration.

