# PART 4: UNIVERSAL HVAC CONTENT SYSTEM

## 8. Replace location-dependent and company-specific assumptions

Audit every existing public page, section, component, metadata field, template, and hardcoded text string.

Identify and remove inappropriate dependencies on:

- One specific city.
- One specific state.
- One specific country.
- One ZIP code.
- One currency.
- One measurement system.
- One phone number.
